 it Earth. Learn about how these grains of Star Dust reveal the cosmic hist
 ory prior to the formation of our sun!\\n\\nMore info: https://www.fieldmu
 seum.org/our-events/meet-a-scientist/presolar-grains-the-oldest-thing-on-e
