 nce to touch unexpected fibers\, and a look at the weaving craft of Coast 
 Salish artist Myrna Crossley. This session is part of our recognition of N
 ative American Heritage Month .\\n\\nMore info: https://www.fieldmuseum.or
 g/our-events/meet-a-scientist/northwest-coast-weaving-and-spinning
